<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates steady, 1-mo 23pct, 3-mo 22.95.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates steady, 1-mo 23pct, 3-mo 22.95.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) remained unchanged for both the one-month and the three-month maturities on Monday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 23 percent and the three-month rate at 22.95 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
